        "Charles L. Bennett",
        "Lyman A. Page Jr.",
        "David N. Spergel"
      ],
      "assessment": {
        "nobel_worthiness": "WMAP's precision mapping of the cosmic microwave background transformed cosmology into a quantitatively tested account of the universe's contents, age, and early structure.",
        "attribution": "Bennett and Page represent the mission's experimental leadership; Spergel's interpretation helped extract its cosmological significance. The prize attribution should distinguish instrument and analysis contributions.",
        "maturity": "The measurements have been repeatedly scrutinized and remain foundational decades later.",
        "uncertainties": [
