      "assessment": {
        "nobel_worthiness": "The measurement of theta-13 established an important neutrino-mixing parameter and opened practical possibilities for testing CP violation in the lepton sector.",
        "attribution": "The named leaders represent key reactor experiments and their international collaborations, but the result depended on large teams and parallel measurements.",
        "maturity": "The disappearance signal was robustly observed and subsequent measurements refined the parameter.",
        "uncertainties": [
