        "attribution": "Hosono's discovery of superconductivity in iron-based compounds and the rapid confirmation and extension by Chen and Zhao make a plausible three-person attribution, subject to priority review.",
        "maturity": "The materials class has been intensively studied for many years, though its pairing mechanism remains unresolved.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "The discovery unfolded through rapid independent work, so the exact original result and fair individual credit need checking."
        ]
      }
    },
