        "nobel_worthiness": "The prediction and observation of correlated states and superconductivity in twisted bilayer graphene opened a striking, experimentally accessible platform for tunable quantum materials.",
        "attribution": "Bistritzer and MacDonald predicted the flat-band mechanism; Jarillo-Herrero's group made the pivotal experimental discovery.",
        "maturity": "The central phenomena have been widely investigated, but the field and interpretation of its superconductivity remain active.",
